{'Parameters': 'whole-match', 'Info': 'Indicates exact matching.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'regular-expression as-regular-expression', 'Info': 'Specifies the regular expression that AS_Path matched.\nThe value is a string of 1 to 80 characters.'}
