{'Parameters': 'labeled-unicast', 'Info': 'Indicates the routing-table is in the BGP labeled address family.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'include-label-route', 'Info': 'Includes labeled routes received from BGP peers as well as locally and remotely leaked VPN routes.\n-'}
