{'Parameters': 'delay delay-time', 'Info': 'Indicates the interval between when BGP detects the peer unreachable and when BGP tears down the corresponding connection.\nThe value is an integer that ranges from 0 to 65535, in seconds. The default value is 0 seconds.'}
{'Parameters': 'ipv6-address', 'Info': 'Specifies the IPv6 address of a peer.\nThe value is a 32-digit hexadecimal number, in the format of X:X:X:X:X:X:X:X.'}
